| Flushing           | 629   | 274   |
| Sunnyside          | 292   | 642   |
| Ditmars            | 978   | 130   |

##### Mathematical Model

**Objective:**
\[
\max \sum_{i \in I} v_i x_i
\]

**Subject to:**
\[
\sum_{i \in I} w_i x_i \leq 586
\]
\[
x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \quad \forall i \in I
\]

